# Ingest / upload

- Accept `.mxl`, `.musicxml`, `.xml` (ABC convert-once is later). Enforce size cap (5–10 MB).
- **XXE:** non-validating parse; reject DTDs / external entities; do not assume `musicxml-io` is safe alone.
- Require **license** before persist. Extract title/composer/key/time/parts from MusicXML header only at upload time.
- Store `scores/{id}/original.*` + `canonical.musicxml`; set `format`, `visibility`, nullable `owner_id`.
- Never ship MusicXML parsers into public list/detail RSC pages.
- Preview SVG (page 1) is generated at ingest, not on every catalog request.
